<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ComplyAI — EU-Compliance für KMUs</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Syne:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}

:root{
  --g:#1a9e6e;
  --g2:#e6f7f1;
  --g3:#0d5c3f;
  --r:#d94f3d;
  --ink:#0f0f0e;
  --ink2:#3a3a38;
  --ink3:#7a7a76;
  --paper:#faf9f6;
  --warm:#f3f1eb;
  --border:rgba(15,15,14,0.1);
  --serif:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;
  --sans:'Syne',sans-serif;
}

html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--sans);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;font-size:16px;font-weight:300;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}

/* ── NAV ── */
nav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:200;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  padding:1rem 3rem;
  background:rgba(250,249,246,0.94);
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border-bottom:.5px solid var(--border);
}
.logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
.logo em{color:var(--g);font-style:italic}
.nav-r{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem}
.lang-btn{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink3);background:none;border:.5px solid var(--border);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s}
.lang-btn:hover{background:var(--warm)}
.nav-cta{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:9px 22px;border-radius:2px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .2s}
.nav-cta:hover{background:var(--g3)}

/* ── HERO ── */
.hero{
  min-height:100vh;display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:0;
  padding-top:0;
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-left{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  padding:5rem 3rem 5rem 3rem;
  position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.hero-right{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:5rem 3rem 5rem 2rem;
  position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.hero-grid-bg{
  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
  background-image:linear-gradient(var(--border) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--border) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:50px 50px;
  opacity:.5;
}
.eyebrow{
  font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--g);margin-bottom:1.25rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.eyebrow::before{content:'';display:block;width:24px;height:1px;background:var(--g)}
h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,3.75rem);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:1.5rem}
h1 em{color:var(--g);font-style:italic}
.hero-sub{font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.75;font-weight:300;margin-bottom:2.5rem;max-width:480px}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:2.5rem;padding-top:1.75rem;border-top:.5px solid var(--border)}
.stat-val{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.75rem;color:var(--ink);display:block;line-height:1}
.stat-val .a{color:var(--g)}
.stat-lbl{font-size:10px;color:var(--ink3);letter-spacing:.04em;margin-top:3px;display:block;line-height:1.35}

/* ── QUIZ CARD ── */
.quiz-card{
  background:var(--paper);border:.5px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:4px;width:100%;max-width:440px;
  box-shadow:0 4px 40px rgba(15,15,14,.06);
  overflow:hidden;
}
.quiz-header{
  padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:.5px solid var(--border);
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;
}
.quiz-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--g)}
.quiz-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink3)}
.quiz-progress{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px;color:var(--ink3)}
.quiz-bar{height:2px;background:var(--border)}
.quiz-bar-fill{height:2px;background:var(--g);transition:width .4s ease}
.quiz-body{padding:1.75rem 1.5rem}
.quiz-q{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.3;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.quiz-opts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}
.quiz-opt{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;
  padding:.75rem 1rem;border:.5px solid var(--border);
  background:var(--paper);cursor:pointer;
  font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink2);
  transition:all .15s;border-radius:2px;
  text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:400;
}
.quiz-opt:hover{background:var(--g2);border-color:var(--g)}
.quiz-opt.selected{background:var(--g2);border-color:var(--g);color:var(--g3);font-weight:500}
.quiz-opt-icon{width:28px;height:28px;border:.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;background:var(--warm)}
.quiz-next{
  margin-top:1.25rem;width:100%;
  background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);
  border:none;padding:.875rem;
  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;
  cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;transition:background .2s;
  display:none;
}
.quiz-next:hover{background:var(--g3)}
.quiz-next.visible{display:block}
.quiz-footer{padding:.875rem 1.5rem;border-top:.5px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink3);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.quiz-lock{color:var(--g);font-size:13px}

/* QUIZ RESULT */
.quiz-result{padding:1.75rem 1.5rem;display:none}
.result-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g);margin-bottom:.75rem}
.result-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:1.25rem;line-height:1.3}
.result-items{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.result-item{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:.75rem;padding:.75rem;background:var(--warm);border-radius:2px}
.result-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:4px}
.result-dot.red{background:#d94f3d}
.result-dot.yellow{background:#e6a817}
.result-dot.green{background:var(--g)}
.result-item p{font-size:.825rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.5}
.result-item strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}
.result-cta{width:100%;background:var(--g);color:white;border:none;padding:1rem;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;transition:background .2s}
.result-cta:hover{background:var(--g3)}
.result-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink3);text-align:center;margin-top:.75rem;line-height:1.5}

/* ── SECTIONS ── */
section{padding:6rem 3rem}
section.alt{background:var(--warm)}
.sec-ey{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--g);margin-bottom:.75rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.sec-ey::before{content:'';display:block;width:16px;height:1px;background:var(--g)}
h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.5vw,2.75rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:var(--ink)}
h2 em{color:var(--g);font-style:italic}
.sec-lead{font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink3);line-height:1.7;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:3rem}

/* HOW IT WORKS */
.how-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.5rem}
.how-card{padding:2rem;border:.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--paper);position:relative}
.how-num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:3.5rem;color:rgba(26,158,110,.12);line-height:1;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.how-card h3{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.how-card p{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink3);line-height:1.65}
.how-conn{position:absolute;right:-16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:32px;height:32px;background:var(--paper);border:.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--g);z-index:2}

/* TRUST */
.trust-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--border)}
.trust-block{background:var(--paper);padding:2rem 1.75rem}
.trust-icon{font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--g);margin-bottom:.875rem}
.trust-block h3{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:.4rem}
.trust-block p{font-size:.825rem;color:var(--ink3);line-height:1.6}
.trust-note{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;background:var(--g2);border-left:3px solid var(--g);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--g3);font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic}

/* COMPARISON */
.vs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
.vs-card{padding:2rem;border:.5px solid var(--border)}
.vs-card.theirs{border-top:3px solid var(--r);background:var(--paper)}
.vs-card.ours{border-top:3px solid var(--g);background:var(--paper)}
.vs-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.75rem}
.vs-card.theirs .vs-label{color:var(--r)}
.vs-card.ours .vs-label{color:var(--g)}
.vs-name{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.2}
.vs-items{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.6rem}
.vs-items li{font-size:.875rem;color:var(--ink2);display:flex;gap:.75rem;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.5}
.vs-x{color:var(--r);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:600}
.vs-c{color:var(--g);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:600}
.vs-note{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:1.5rem 2rem;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7}
.vs-note strong{color:#a8e6cf}

/* WAITLIST */
.wl-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem;align-items:center}
.wl-left h2{margin-bottom:.75rem}
.wl-left p{font-size:1rem;color:var(--ink2);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:0}
.wl-form{background:var(--paper);border:.5px solid var(--border);padding:2rem}
.wl-field{margin-bottom:1rem}
.wl-field label{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink3);margin-bottom:.4rem}
.wl-field input,.wl-field select{
  width:100%;padding:.75rem 1rem;border:.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--warm);
  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink);border-radius:2px;
  transition:border-color .15s;outline:none;
}
.wl-field input:focus,.wl-field select:focus{border-color:var(--g)}
.wl-price-opts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.5rem;margin-top:.25rem}
.price-opt{
  padding:.6rem .5rem;border:.5px solid var(--border);background:var(--warm);
  cursor:pointer;font-size:.825rem;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink2);
  border-radius:2px;transition:all .15s;text-align:center;
}
.price-opt:hover{background:var(--g2);border-color:var(--g)}
.price-opt.sel{background:var(--g2);border-color:var(--g);color:var(--g3);font-weight:500}
.wl-submit{
  width:100%;background:var(--g);color:white;border:none;
  padding:1rem;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;border-radius:2px;
  transition:background .2s;margin-top:.25rem;
}
.wl-submit:hover{background:var(--g3)}
.wl-disclaimer{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink3);margin-top:.875rem;line-height:1.5}
.wl-success{display:none;text-align:center;padding:2rem 1rem}
.wl-success-icon{font-size:2rem;color:var(--g);margin-bottom:.75rem}
.wl-success h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.wl-success p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink3);line-height:1.65}

/* EXIT / MOAT */
.moat-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0}
.moat-left{padding:6rem 3rem;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
.moat-left .sec-ey{color:var(--g)}
.moat-left .sec-ey::before{background:var(--g)}
.moat-left h2{color:var(--paper)}
.moat-right{padding:6rem 3rem;background:var(--ink2)}
.moat-list{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;margin-top:2rem}
.moat-item{display:flex;gap:1.25rem;padding:1.25rem 0;border-bottom:.5px solid rgba(250,249,246,.1)}
.moat-item:first-child{border-top:.5px solid rgba(250,249,246,.1)}
.moat-n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;color:rgba(26,158,110,.4);flex-shrink:0;line-height:1}
.moat-item h3{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--paper);margin-bottom:.25rem}
.moat-item p{font-size:.825rem;color:rgba(250,249,246,.55);line-height:1.6}
.exit-content{color:rgba(250,249,246,.7)}
.exit-content p{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.exit-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.5rem}
.exit-chip{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.05em;border:.5px solid rgba(250,249,246,.2);padding:5px 14px;color:rgba(250,249,246,.6)}

/* FOOTER */
footer{padding:2.5rem 3rem;border-top:.5px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:var(--paper)}
.footer-logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}
.footer-logo em{color:var(--g);font-style:italic}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:2rem}
.footer-links a{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink3);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.03em}
.footer-links a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.footer-r{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink3)}

/* FADE IN */
.fi{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .55s ease,transform .55s ease}
.fi.in{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}

/* LANGUAGE */
.en{display:none}
body.lang-en .de{display:none}
body.lang-en .en{display:block}
body.lang-en .en-flex{display:flex}
body.lang-en .de-flex{display:none}

/* MOBILE */
@media(max-width:900px){
  nav{padding:1rem 1.25rem}
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:auto}
  .hero-left{padding:3.5rem 1.25rem 2rem}
  .hero-right{padding:0 1.25rem 3.5rem}
  section{padding:3.5rem 1.25rem}
  .how-grid,.vs-grid,.wl-wrap,.trust-grid,.moat-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .moat-left,.moat-right{padding:3.5rem 1.25rem}
  .hero-stats{gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  footer{flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;text-align:center;padding:2rem 1.25rem}
  .footer-links{flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .how-conn{display:none}
  .nav-r .nav-cta{padding:8px 14px;font-size:11px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a href="#" class="logo">Comply<em>AI</em></a>
  <div class="nav-r">
    <button class="lang-btn" onclick="toggleLang()" id="langBtn">EN</button>
    <a href="#waitlist" class="nav-cta de">Kostenlos prüfen</a>
    <a href="#waitlist" class="nav-cta en" style="display:none">Get early access</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid-bg"></div>

  <div class="hero-left">
    <p class="eyebrow de">B2B SaaS · DACH · EU Compliance</p>
    <p class="eyebrow en">B2B SaaS · DACH · EU Compliance</p>

    <h1 class="de">EU-Compliance —<br><em>endlich</em><br>verstehen.</h1>
    <h1 class="en">EU Compliance —<br><em>finally</em><br>make sense of it.</h1>

    <p class="hero-sub de">Kein Anwalt, kein Berater, keine Überraschungen. ComplyAI zeigt dir in Minuten, welche Gesetze für dein Unternehmen gelten — und was du wirklich tun musst.</p>
    <p class="hero-sub en">No lawyer, no consultant, no nasty surprises. ComplyAI shows you in minutes which EU regulations apply to your business — and exactly what to do about them.</p>

    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div>
        <span class="stat-val">3,5<span class="a">M</span></span>
        <span class="stat-lbl de">KMUs in DACH betroffen</span>
        <span class="stat-lbl en">SMEs affected in DACH</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="stat-val">3<span class="a">+</span></span>
        <span class="stat-lbl de">neue EU-Gesetze seit 2024</span>
        <span class="stat-lbl en">new EU laws since 2024</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="stat-val">€<span class="a">0</span></span>
        <span class="stat-lbl de">einfache KMU-Lösung bisher</span>
        <span class="stat-lbl en">simple SME solution exists</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-right">
    <!-- QUIZ CARD -->
    <div class="quiz-card" id="quizCard">
      <div class="quiz-header">
        <div class="quiz-dot"></div>
        <span class="quiz-title de">Schnell-Check · 4 Fragen</span>
        <span class="quiz-title en" style="display:none">Quick Check · 4 Questions</span>
        <span class="quiz-progress" id="quizProgress">1 / 4</span>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-bar"><div class="quiz-bar-fill" id="quizFill" style="width:25%"></div></div>

      <div class="quiz-body" id="quizBody">
        <!-- Steps injected by JS -->
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-result" id="quizResult">
        <p class="result-label de">Dein Beispiel-Ergebnis</p>
        <p class="result-label en" style="display:none">Your Sample Result</p>
        <p class="result-title de">3 Bereiche für dein Unternehmen identifiziert</p>
        <p class="result-title en" style="display:none">3 areas identified for your business</p>
        <div class="result-items" id="resultItems"></div>
        <button class="result-cta" onclick="document.getElementById('waitlist').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
          <span class="de">Vollständige Analyse starten →</span>
          <span class="en">Get full analysis →</span>
        </button>
        <p class="result-note de">Dies ist ein Beispiel. Die vollständige Analyse startet nach der Registrierung.</p>
        <p class="result-note en">This is a sample. Full analysis available after sign-up.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-footer">
        <span class="quiz-lock">🔒</span>
        <span class="de">Keine sensiblen Daten · DSGVO-konform</span>
        <span class="en">No sensitive data · GDPR-compliant</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="alt" id="produkt">
  <div class="sec-ey de">So funktioniert es</div>
  <div class="sec-ey en">How it works</div>
  <h2 class="de">Drei Schritte zu <em>klarer</em> Compliance.</h2>
  <h2 class="en">Three steps to <em>clear</em> compliance.</h2>
  <p class="sec-lead de">Von der Eingabe bis zum fertigen Dokument — ohne Anwalt, ohne Überraschungen.</p>
  <p class="sec-lead en">From input to finished document — no lawyer, no surprises.</p>
  <div class="how-grid fi">
    <div class="how-card">
      <div class="how-num">01</div>
      <h3 class="de">Unternehmen beschreiben</h3>
      <h3 class="en">Describe your business</h3>
      <p class="de">Branche, Größe, Tätigkeitsfeld — in strukturierten Feldern, keine sensiblen Daten nötig. Dauert zwei Minuten.</p>
      <p class="en">Industry, size, activity — in structured fields, no sensitive data required. Takes two minutes.</p>
      <div class="how-conn">→</div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-card">
      <div class="how-num">02</div>
      <h3 class="de">Lücken sehen</h3>
      <h3 class="en">See the gaps</h3>
      <p class="de">Das Ampel-Dashboard zeigt welche Pflichten offen sind, welche Fristen laufen und wo das größte Risiko liegt.</p>
      <p class="en">The traffic light dashboard shows open obligations, running deadlines and where the biggest risk lies.</p>
      <div class="how-conn">→</div>
    </div>
    <div class="how-card">
      <div class="how-num">03</div>
      <h3 class="de">Dokumente generieren</h3>
      <h3 class="en">Generate documents</h3>
      <p class="de">Per Klick: Datenschutzerklärung, AVV-Vorlage, AI Act Konformitätsdokument — branchenspezifisch, sofort verwendbar.</p>
      <p class="en">One click: Privacy policy, DPA template, AI Act conformity document — industry-specific, ready to use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST / DATENSCHUTZ -->
<section id="datenschutz">
  <div class="sec-ey de">Datenschutz</div>
  <div class="sec-ey en">Privacy</div>
  <h2 class="de">DSGVO-konform <em>by design.</em></h2>
  <h2 class="en">GDPR-compliant <em>by design.</em></h2>
  <p class="sec-lead de">Eine Compliance-Plattform die selbst nicht compliant ist — das wäre absurd. Drei Architekturentscheidungen die das garantieren.</p>
  <p class="sec-lead en">A compliance platform that isn't compliant itself — that would be absurd. Three architectural decisions that guarantee it.</p>
  <div class="trust-grid fi">
    <div class="trust-block">
      <div class="trust-icon">◎</div>
      <h3 class="de">Keine sensiblen Daten nötig</h3>
      <h3 class="en">No sensitive data required</h3>
      <p class="de">Der Kern arbeitet mit Branche, Größe und Tätigkeitsfeld — Dropdowns und Checkboxen, kein Freitext, keine personenbezogenen Daten.</p>
      <p class="en">The core works with industry, size and activity — dropdowns and checkboxes, no free text, no personal data.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-block">
      <div class="trust-icon">◉</div>
      <h3 class="de">Data Processing Agreement</h3>
      <h3 class="en">Data Processing Agreement</h3>
      <p class="de">DPA mit KI-Anbieter gemäß Art. 28 DSGVO, EU-US Data Privacy Framework — jede Verarbeitung ist rechtlich vollständig abgesichert.</p>
      <p class="en">DPA with AI provider under Art. 28 GDPR, EU-US Data Privacy Framework — every processing step is legally covered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trust-block">
      <div class="trust-icon">⬡</div>
      <h3 class="de">Hinweis, keine Rechtsberatung</h3>
      <h3 class="en">Guidance, not legal advice</h3>
      <p class="de">ComplyAI zeigt dir was du prüfen musst — nicht ob du compliant bist. Die Haftung bleibt bei dir. Das ist ehrlich und das sagen wir auch so.</p>
      <p class="en">ComplyAI shows you what to check — not whether you're compliant. Liability stays with you. We're honest about that.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-note fi de">"DSGVO-konform by design ist kein Hindernis — es ist unser stärkstes Verkaufsargument."</div>
  <div class="trust-note fi en">"GDPR-compliant by design isn't a constraint — it's our strongest selling point."</div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARISON -->
<section class="alt" id="vergleich">
  <div class="sec-ey de">Wettbewerb</div>
  <div class="sec-ey en">Comparison</div>
  <h2 class="de">Warum nicht einfach <em>einen Berater</em>?</h2>
  <h2 class="en">Why not just hire <em>a consultant</em>?</h2>
  <p class="sec-lead de">DataGuard und heyData existieren — aber beide sind entweder zu teuer oder zu komplex für den echten Mittelstand.</p>
  <p class="sec-lead en">DataGuard and heyData exist — but both are either too expensive or too complex for real SMEs.</p>
  <div class="vs-grid fi">
