      <p class="vs-label de">Bestehende Lösungen</p>
      <p class="vs-label en">Existing solutions</p>
      <p class="vs-name de">DataGuard, heyData & Co.</p>
      <p class="vs-name en">DataGuard, heyData & others</p>
