        <li><span class="vs-x">✕</span><span class="de">Ab €500/Monat — zu teuer für KMUs unter 50 Mitarbeitern</span><span class="en">From €500/month — too expensive for SMEs under 50 employees</span></li>
        <li><span class="vs-x">✕</span><span class="de">Berater nötig — kein echtes Self-Service</span><span class="en">Consultant required — not true self-service</span></li>
        <li><span class="vs-x">✕</span><span class="de">Fokus auf DSGVO und NIS2 — AI Act kaum abgedeckt</span><span class="en">Focus on GDPR and NIS2 — AI Act barely covered</span></li>
        <li><span class="vs-x">✕</span><span class="de">Kein Dokument-Generator für spezifische Rechtsformen</span><span class="en">No document generator for specific legal forms</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="vs-card ours">
      <p class="vs-label">ComplyAI</p>
      <p class="vs-name de">Gemacht für den echten Mittelstand.</p>
      <p class="vs-name en">Built for real SMEs.</p>
      <ul class="vs-items">
        <li><span class="vs-c">✓</span><span class="de">Self-Service — kein Berater, keine Wartezeit</span><span class="en">Self-service — no consultant, no waiting</span></li>
        <li><span class="vs-c">✓</span><span class="de">DSGVO + AI Act + HGB in einem Tool</span><span class="en">GDPR + AI Act + disclosure obligations in one tool</span></li>
        <li><span class="vs-c">✓</span><span class="de">Dokument-Generator: sofort verwendbar, branchenspezifisch</span><span class="en">Document generator: ready to use, industry-specific</span></li>
        <li><span class="vs-c">✓</span><span class="de">Erschwinglich — für jedes KMU</span><span class="en">Affordable — for every SME</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="vs-note fi de"><strong>Das eigentliche Argument:</strong> Die meisten KMUs haben gar keinen Compliance-Beauftragten. Sie können sich keinen leisten. ComplyAI gibt ihnen zum ersten Mal eine funktionierende Compliance-Struktur — ohne Stundensatz.</div>
  <div class="vs-note fi en"><strong>The real argument:</strong> Most SMEs don't have a compliance officer. They can't afford one. ComplyAI gives them a working compliance structure for the first time — without hourly rates.</div>
</section>

